<title>USA: Asia Pulp &amp; Paper Q3 net $33.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper Q3 net $33.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net per ADS		$0.17			n/a</p>
<p> Net			 33,801			n/a</p>
<p> Sales		    414,989			n/a</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Net per ADS		$0.55		    $1.05</p>
<p> Net			110,772		  197,526</p>
<p> Sales		  1,239,389		1,435,532</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Consolidated net income figures for 1996 includes minority interest.</p>
<p>Income from operations for the nine-months 1996 was $257.9 million, compared to income from operations of $517.8 million in the nine months 1995.  </p>
<p>Amounts determined following generally accepted accounting priciples in Indonesia.</p>
<p>Based on U.S. GAAP, earnings per ADS for the 1996 Q3 would have been $0.12. Based on U.S. GAAP, earnings per ADS for the 1996 nine-months would have been $0.43, compared with $0.77 for the 1995 period.</p>
<p>Full company name is Asia Pulp &amp; Paper Co Ltd.</p>
